# Every text file is LF, in the repository and in every checkout.
#
# The repository was already LF throughout. What this fixes is the checkout:
# with core.autocrlf=true on a Windows machine, a fresh worktree was written
# out with CRLF, and four tests that compare source text against LF strings
# failed there while passing on main and in CI. eol=lf overrides autocrlf, so
# a checkout matches the repository on every machine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, so they are never touched.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
